{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-9050761","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年鸭川海洋世界","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-11-08","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 感動の連続！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-9050761/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录在鸭川海洋世界接连不断的感动：白鲸、海豚、虎鲸与训练师带来精彩表演。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 感動の連続！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/9050761.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20161112172224id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/9050761.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">鸭川海洋世界！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/001-145efaddca.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/001-145efaddca.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n进去\n突然出现的是……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n白鲸！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/002-7f1207fcdf.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/002-7f1207fcdf.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n超可爱！\n这是什么可爱程度！\n\n<br>\n\n\n还能进行回声定位，\n还会模仿声音，\n擅长本领可真多的白鲸！\n\n<br>\n\n\n可爱！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/003-391ce831ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/003-391ce831ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n讲解也很容易理解，\n和白鲸配合得天衣无缝！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n说到\n鸭川海洋世界，\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/004-7c62bd2cb2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/004-7c62bd2cb2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n速度感太强了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n4只海豚出色的团队协作！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n说到鸭川海洋世界的话！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就是这里！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/005-fdcd2f2a19.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/005-fdcd2f2a19.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n虎鲸！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我那位做虎鲸训练师的亲戚美和酱大显身手！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/006-ea649dc158.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/006-ea649dc158.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n        太厉害了！！\n    \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n虎鲸和训练师之间美好的关系！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有爱！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/007-fba66b72c3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/007-fba66b72c3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n最后的这个场景……\n\n<br>\n\n\n我都快哭了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n和训练师之间的羁绊，\n真的太美好了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n美和酱，\n\n虎鲸拉拉，\n谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我收获了满满的感动！\n也充满了活力！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n白鲸、海豚、虎鲸们，\n还有各位训练师，\n谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/008-b933b8ba29.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/008-b933b8ba29.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"959\" height=\"1278\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家也一定要去！\n感动接连不断的\n<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.kamogawa-seaworld.jp/smp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">鸭川海洋世界！</a>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">鴨川シーワールド！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/001-145efaddca.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/001-145efaddca.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        入って\nいきなり現れたのは・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nベルーガ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/002-7f1207fcdf.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/002-7f1207fcdf.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nむっちゃかわいい！\n何この可愛さ！\n\n<br>\n\n\nエコーロケーションや\n音の真似も出来て\n得意技が多いベルーガ！\n\n<br>\n\n\nかわいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/003-391ce831ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/003-391ce831ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n解説も分かりやすくて\nベルーガとの息もピッタリ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nイルカ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/004-7c62bd2cb2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/004-7c62bd2cb2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n速度感ハンパない！\n\n<br>\n\n\n4匹のイルカたちの\n素晴らしいチームワーク！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして鴨川シーワールドと言えば！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこちら！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/005-fdcd2f2a19.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/005-fdcd2f2a19.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nシャチ！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n親戚のシャチトレーナー\n美和ちゃん大活躍！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/006-ea649dc158.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/006-ea649dc158.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"930\" height=\"1259\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n        すげーー！！\n    \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nシャチとトレーナーの素晴らしい関係！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして愛！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/007-fba66b72c3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/9050761/007-fba66b72c3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\"></a></figure>\n\n最後のこのシーン・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n泣きそうになったよ・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nトレーナーとの絆\n本当に素晴らしい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n美和ちゃん\n\nシャチのララちゃん\nありがとう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nむっちゃ感動をもらったよ！\n元気をもらったよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n